  <TITLE>Influence of microaeration on anaerobic digestion of aniline</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>In this study, the intermittent micro aeration influence on anaerobic digestion of aniline was tested in a bench-scale reactor inoculated with anaerobic textile and petrochemical sludges.</DESCRIPTION>
